  "body": "If resort style living is your vibe, then this is your perfect, private sanctuary to escape to at the end of a busy day. A stylish, contemporary family home where the pool is heated, the garden is tropical, the pizza oven is ready to be fired up and there's always somewhere to relax. Set on a 615sqm freehold section in Stanmore Bay, this beautifully designed 236sqm home delivers the kind of effortless indoor-outdoor lifestyle that makes busy family life feel a whole lot more fun and fabulous.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Approx 236sqm, multi-level home with quality finishes throughout\r\n* 615sqm section with fully fenced backyard\r\n* Four generous double bedrooms and two bathrooms\r\n* Designer kitchen and spacious open-plan living\r\n* Seamless connection to the private tropical garden\r\n* Heated salt-water swimming pool for extended enjoyment\r\n* Spa pool for unwinding at the end of the day\r\n* Bamboo flooring and new carpets\r\n* Heat pumps and a fireplace ensure a warm comfortable home\r\n* Pizza oven and fantastic outdoor entertaining spaces\r\n* Generous garaging with plenty of practical storage\r\n\r\nStanmore Bay gives you that coveted coastal family lifestyle, with beaches, parks, excellent schools, local shops, cafes and leisure facilities all really close by. Whether it's summer afternoons around the pool, relaxed weekends entertaining friends or simply enjoying your own private space, this is a home designed to make everyday living feel special. With Penlink under construction, connection to this sought after coastal community is only getting better, now is the time to buy here.\r\n\r\nIf you've been searching for a stylish, edgy and practical family home with a pool, spa and serious entertaining appeal, 9 Andre Rise deserves to be at the top of your viewing list. Give me a call - you'll want to see this one in person.\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/GIBU\r\n\r\nFlexible settlement terms available.\r\nOther agents - bring your buyers. Conjunctionals welcome.",
